0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 8.1 kg (16.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 8.1 kg (16.2 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 380 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  380  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">22bf3680-a37f-4a04-b036-2865805f3d60</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22bf3680-a37f-4a04-b036-2865805f3d60\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22bf3680-a37f-4a04-b036-2865805f3d60\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Harold_HeavyCrossbow+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Haroldish_Doom\" title=\"Haroldish Doom\">Haroldish Doom</a></dt><dd>When dealing damage to a target with a ranged weapon, the target must succeed a Charisma <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throw</a> or be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Bane_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane (Condition)\">Baned</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Shot\" title=\"Piercing Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp/60px-Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp/80px-Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Shot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Piercing_Shot_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Shot\" title=\"Piercing Shot\">Piercing Shot</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Deal regular damage and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaping Wounds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a> which cause extra damage on attacks. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brace_(Ranged)\" title=\"Brace (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brace (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Brace_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brace_(Ranged)\" title=\"Brace (Ranged)\">Brace (Ranged)</a> (<span aria-label=\"Movement Speed\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Spend 6 m (20 ft) of your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">movement</a>. For the rest of your turn, roll ranged damage twice and use the highest result. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Hideout\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zhentarim Hideout\">Zhentarim Hideout</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;277&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-247</span>: Reward for bringing the chest to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zarys\" title=\"Zarys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/25px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/38px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/50px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zarys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png/25px-Portrait_Zarys.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Portrait_Zarys.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zarys\" title=\"Zarys\">Zarys</a> as part of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find the Missing Shipment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\">Find the Missing Shipment</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>For Zarys to reward the party with this item, they must either have <i>not</i> made a deal with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rugan\" title=\"Rugan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Rugan.png/25px-Portrait_Rugan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Rugan.png/38px-Portrait_Rugan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Rugan.png/50px-Portrait_Rugan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rugan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Rugan.png/25px-Portrait_Rugan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Portrait_Rugan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rugan\" title=\"Rugan\">Rugan</a> to pretend that the shipment is lost, <i>or</i> they must have killed Rugan and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Olly\" title=\"Olly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Olly.png/25px-Portrait_Olly.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Olly.png/38px-Portrait_Olly.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Olly.png/50px-Portrait_Olly.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Olly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Portrait_Olly.png/25px-Portrait_Olly.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Portrait_Olly.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Olly\" title=\"Olly\">Olly</a> after doing so and <i>before</i> entering the Zhentarim hideout. If Zarys learns of any misdealing the party members are locked out of acquiring this item, since it cannot be looted or bought.</li>\n<li>Harold is also found in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Siege_of_Dragonspear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate: Siege of Dragonspear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Siege_of_Dragonspear\">Baldur's Gate: Siege of Dragonspear</a></span>. However, the description of the item <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Harold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Harold\">Harold</a></span> differs slightly from the new one. That weapon had a chance of inflicting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Doom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Doom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Doom\">Doom</a></span>, as the spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/38px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/50px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp/25px-Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Bane_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(spell)\" title=\"Bane (spell)\">Bane</a> did not exist in the <i>Advanced Dungeons &amp; Dragons 2nd Edition</i> ruleset used by the older games.</li></ul>\n\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Harold_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Harold_ingame.png/450px-Harold_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/3/35/Harold_ingame.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Harold_ingame.png/450px-Harold_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Harold_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195605\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.135 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.143 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5678/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75843/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16693/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 808/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.043/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1638149/52428800 bytes\n-->\n